{
    "title": "Dovly: Grow your Credit Score",
    "description": "Boost your credit score fast with an AI credit engine proven to optimize results. Dovly AI is more than a credit builder, credit repair app or credit monitoring app. It's all things credit, all in one app, for all Americans. Give your fico credit score an extra grow, monitor your credit report with Dovly's AI engine.\r\n\r\nDownload the only credit app you'll ever need, let Dovly's AI credit engine work on your behalf to repair, (re) build, monitor, and protect your fico credit score \u2013 100% free. No credit card required. Do you want to increase the credit report you see on TransUnion, Experian and Equifax? Join the members that see a 82 pt credit score increase. *\r\n\r\nAchieving major life milestones made easy with Dovly's AI credit engine. Kick off the path to an extra increase in your fico credit score, grow credit with AI and experience a boost good credit karma for yourself.\r\n\r\nGet approved for a new credit card, secure a mortgage, save money to your wallet, start planning your future family - endless possibilities & a happier wallet with better credit. Enroll in minutes online (no call center agents!) and get a head-turning fico credit score with credit monitoring, alerts, scores, tips and tricks \u2013 for free. Get credit monitoring, alerts, TransUnion credit score, tips and tricks. All credit, no karma! Let AI do the credit heavy lifting for you, no extra cost.\r\n\r\nWith more than 9,000,000 total points increased **, Dovly's AI credit repair engine know what it takes to make your credit grow right. Say goodbye to lawyers, paid credit repair companies, and juggling multiple online tools like Credit Karma, Self and Kikoff credit builder app and say hello to Dovly's AI credit score app. Provides access to AI-powered disputes & corrections with the credit bureaus: TransUnion \u00ae, Experian and Equifax. Monthly TransUnion free credit score and credit report, personalized credit tips, credit health & other financial product recommendations \u2013 all in one place. Get access to your TransUnion credit report for free.\r\n\r\nGet the extra help you need to grow your fico credit with Dovly. Credit Karma 2.0. No need to use multiple apps like Credit Karma, Kikoff, Self or Extra, Dovly is your one stop shop for all your credit building needs. Dovly uses AI to boost & grow credit, aligning your karma towards a better future. Be kind to your wallet.\r\n\r\nAdd good karma and a boost to your credit building journey!\r\n\r\n\r\n* Average increase experienced by a sample of 30,746 Dovly Premium AI members that have been enrolled more than 6 months, as of November 2024.\r\n** The combined total credit score increase among Dovly members through November 2024.\r\n\r\nTerms and conditions: https://www.dovly.com/terms-conditions/\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.dovly.com/privacy-policy",
